  "tha-ap461:1.1": "Niharante sarīramhi ",
  "tha-ap461:1.2": "vajjamānāsu bherisu / ",
  "tha-ap461:1.3": "pasannacitto sumano ",
  "tha-ap461:1.4": "sattipuppham apūjayiṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap461:2.1": "Satasahasse ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap461:2.2": "yaṃ puppham abhipūjayiṃ / ",
  "tha-ap461:2.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap461:2.4": "dehapūjāy' idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap461:3.1": "Kilesā . . . ",
  "tha-ap461:3.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap461:3.3": "",
  "tha-ap461:4.1": "",
  "tha-ap461:4.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap461:4.3": "pe . . . // // Sāgataṃ . . . pe . . . pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap461:5.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap461:5.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap461:5.3": "pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap461:6.1": "Itthaṃ sudam āyasmā sattipaṇṇiyo thero i. g. a-ti. Sattipaṇṇiyattherassa apadānaṃ samattaṃ. Citesu kiramānesu ",
